{"id":"gemu_tlich","lemma":"gemütlich","pos":"adv","rank":2568,"glosses":["unhurried, leisurely"],"ipa":"/ɡəˈmyːtlɪç/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/2f/De-gem%C3%BCtlich.ogg/De-gem%C3%BCtlich.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Das Bett ist sehr gemütlich.","en":"The bed is very comfortable.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/565919","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"bed (piece of furniture"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"very"},null]},{"text":"Ich finde es hier sehr gemütlich.","en":"I find it very comfortable here.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to find","l":"finden"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"here"},{"g":"very"},null]},{"text":"Dieser Raum ist gemütlich.","en":"This room is comfortable.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/567098","words":[{"g":"this one, this"},{"g":"space"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null]},{"text":"Drinnen war es warm und gemütlich.","en":"It was warm and cozy inside.","words":[{"g":"inside"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"warm"},{"g":"and"},null]},{"text":"Mach es dir bitte gemütlich.","en":"Please make yourself comfortable.","words":[{"g":"to make","l":"machen"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"du"},{"g":"please"},null]}]}